---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="How It Works | Hendrix Ventures Group"
  description="How selling your Atlanta house to Hendrix Ventures Group works: a written offer after one walkthrough, how the offer is calculated, an honest comparison with listing, and a Georgia attorney at every closing."
  path="/how-it-works"
>
  <section class="hiw-intro">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1>How it works</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Three steps, no surprises — and enough detail on this page that you
        know exactly what happens before you ever talk to us.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hiw-steps">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <ol class="hiw-list" role="list">
        <li>
          <h2>1 · Tell us about the house</h2>
          <p>
            Two minutes on <a href="/get-offer">the offer form</a>, or one
            phone call to <a href="tel:+16787105786">(678) 710-5786</a>. All we
            need up front is the address and how to reach you. You'll talk to
            Hasani — not a call center, not a script.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>2 · We look at the house and put an offer in writing</h2>
          <p>
            We visit in person or do a quick video walkthrough — whichever you
            prefer. Don't clean, don't repair, don't apologize for the house;
            we've bought houses in every condition. You'll usually have a
            written offer within 24 hours of the walkthrough.
          </p>
          <p>
            The offer is free, it's in writing, and it doesn't expire on our
            schedule. Take it to your attorney or a licensed agent — we
            genuinely encourage it.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>3 · You pick the closing date</h2>
          <p>
            Close in days, or months out — whatever your situation needs.
            Georgia law requires every real-estate closing to be conducted by
            a licensed closing attorney, and that protects you: the attorney
            verifies the title, supervises every signature, and your money
            flows through the attorney's escrow account — never through us.
            You get paid at closing.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hiw-math">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2>How we calculate an offer</h2>
      <p>
        No mystery, no algorithm theater. Every offer is built the same way:
      </p>
      <ul class="math-list" role="list">
        <li>
          <strong>What the house will be worth</strong> after it's fully
          repaired, based on real sales near you
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>minus the cost of repairs</strong> — the work you're
          choosing not to do
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>minus our costs</strong> — closing, holding, and selling
          costs we take on
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>minus our profit</strong> — we're a business, and we'd
          rather say that plainly than hide it
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Because we take on the repairs, the costs, and the risk, our number
        isn't a retail listing price — it's a certain one. What it buys you
        is real: no repairs, no cleanouts, no showings, no commissions, no
        fees, no financing fall-throughs, and a closing date you control.
        You'll always know exactly where the number came from.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hiw-compare">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Selling to us vs. listing — honestly</h2>
      <div class="table-scroll">
        <table>
          <caption class="sr-only">
            Comparison of selling to Hendrix Ventures Group versus listing
            with an agent
          </caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col"></th>
              <th scope="col">Sell to us</th>
              <th scope="col">List with an agent</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Likely price</th>
              <td>A certain, written number — built for speed and simplicity</td>
              <td><strong>Usually the most money</strong> if the house shows
                well and you can wait</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Repairs &amp; cleanout</th>
              <td>None — we buy as-is, leave what you don't want</td>
              <td>Typically needed before showings</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Commissions &amp; fees</th>
              <td>None</td>
              <td>Commonly around 5–6% plus concessions</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Showings</th>
              <td>One walkthrough</td>
              <td>Ongoing until it sells</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Timeline</th>
              <td>You pick the date — days or months</td>
              <td>Often 1–3+ months, plus buyer financing time</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Certainty</th>
              <td>Written offer; the number doesn't change at the table</td>
              <td>Buyer financing and inspections can reopen or end the deal</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="compare-honesty">
        <strong>Our honest advice:</strong> if your house is in great shape
        and you have a few months, listing can net you more — and if you call
        us and that's your situation, we'll say so. We're the right call when
        the house needs work, the timeline is short, or you just want it
        done, safely, without the circus.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hiw-cta">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2>See your number</h2>
      <p>
        Free, written, no obligation — and no is always an acceptable answer.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/get-offer" class="btn btn-primary">Get my cash offer</a>
        <a href="tel:+16787105786" class="btn btn-secondary"
          >Call or text (678) 710-5786</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hiw-intro {
    padding-block: var(--space-7) var(--space-4);
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  .hiw-steps {
    padding-block: var(--space-5);
  }
  .hiw-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }
  .hiw-list h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
  }
  .hiw-math {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    padding-block: var(--space-7);
  }
  .math-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .math-list li {
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent-warm);
  }
  .hiw-compare {
    padding-block: var(--space-7);
  }
  .table-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 56rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  th,
  td {
    text-align: left;
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  thead th {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
  }
  tbody th {
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .compare-honesty {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    background: var(--color-brand-tint);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  .hiw-cta {
    padding-block: var(--space-7) var(--space-8);
  }
  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
</style>
